      "title": "Lekker food",
      "explanation": [
        "**lekker** is the most useful word in Afrikaans: tasty, nice, great. **Die kos is lekker!** (**kos** also means food.)",
        "A **braai** is a South African barbecue, a big part of social life. You'll eat **vleis** (meat) and **boerewors** (spiced farm sausage).",
        "**hou** = hold: **Ons hou 'n braai.** = We're having a braai."
      ],
      "examples": [
        {
          "af": "Die kos is baie lekker!",
          "en": "The food is very tasty!"
        },
        {
          "af": "Ons hou Saterdag 'n braai.",
          "en": "We're having a braai on Saturday."
        },
        {
          "af": "Ek eet vleis en boerewors.",
          "en": "I'm eating meat and boerewors."
        }
      ],
